replace_article("d1009", r'''<article class="day" id="d1009"><div class="dayhead"><div><h3>10/9 周五 · 阿斯塔纳：大清真寺、Bayterek → 乌鲁木齐</h3><div class="sub">凌晨抵达后先在机场休息，白天游览阿斯塔纳核心地标，晚上返回机场搭乘航班前往乌鲁木齐。</div></div><div class="walk"><b>约 5–7 km</b>景点之间以打车为主 · ★★★☆☆</div></div>
  <div class="route-ribbon"><span>NQZ</span><i class="arrow">→</i><span>Astana Grand Mosque</span><i class="arrow">→</i><span>National Museum</span><i class="arrow">→</i><span>Bayterek</span><i class="arrow">→</i><span>Nurzhol</span><i class="arrow">→</i><span>Khan Shatyr</span><i class="arrow">→</i><span>NQZ</span></div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="step"><div class="time">02:00–03:15</div><h4>NQZ T1 · 入境 + 行李确认</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/nqz-airport.jpg" alt="Astana NQZ Airport" loading="lazy"><p>办理哈萨克斯坦入境，并根据行李牌确认托运行李状态。订单提示阿斯塔纳段<b>可能需要领取并重新托运行李</b>；如行李只挂到 NQZ，先领取行李。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">03:15–06:30</div><h4>NQZ T1 · 机场休息</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/nqz-airport.jpg" alt="阿斯塔纳机场" loading="lazy"><p>凌晨留在机场公共区域休息，护照、手机和银行卡贴身保管；天亮后再进入市区。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">06:30–07:00</div><h4>寄存行李</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/nqz-airport.jpg" alt="阿斯塔纳机场行李寄存" loading="lazy"><p>如已领取大件行李，使用机场行李寄存服务后轻装出发；若行李已直挂 URC，则直接整理随身物品。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">07:00–07:40</div><h4>早餐 + 前往 Astana Grand Mosque</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/food/croissant.jpg" alt="阿斯塔纳早餐" loading="lazy"><p>在机场简单早餐后乘正规出租车 / 网约车前往 <b>Astana Grand Mosque</b>。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">07:45–09:15</div><h4>Astana Grand Mosque</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/astana-mosque.jpg" alt="Astana Grand Mosque" loading="lazy"><p>参观蓝色穹顶大清真寺的外观和内部空间。女性准备可覆盖头发的围巾，衣着遮肩遮膝，入内脱鞋。10/9为周五，安排在早晨可避开中午聚礼时段。</p><div class="btnrow"><a class="btn light" href="https://visitastana.kz/en/about-city/what-to-see/mechet-v-g-nur-sultan/" target="_blank">Visit Astana</a><a class="btn light" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Astana%20Grand%20Mosque" target="_blank">地图</a></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">09:15–10:00</div><h4>Grand Mosque → National Museum</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/kazakhstan-museum.jpg" alt="National Museum of Kazakhstan" loading="lazy"><p>乘车前往 National Museum；如提前抵达，可在 Independence Square 一带短暂停留。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">10:00–11:30</div><h4>National Museum of Kazakhstan</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/kazakhstan-museum.jpg" alt="哈萨克斯坦国家博物馆" loading="lazy"><p>重点参观 Golden Man、古代游牧文明、哈萨克民族文化和阿斯塔纳城市发展相关展厅，预留约1.5小时。</p><div class="btnrow"><a class="btn" href="https://nmrk.kz/en/" target="_blank">国家博物馆官方</a></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">11:30–12:30</div><h4>午餐 + 前往 Bayterek</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/baiterek.jpg" alt="Bayterek" loading="lazy"><p>在新城核心区附近解决午餐，之后前往 Bayterek。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">12:30–15:10</div><h4>Bayterek → Nurzhol Boulevard → Ak Orda</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/baiterek.jpg" alt="Bayterek 阿斯塔纳" loading="lazy"><p>游览 Bayterek，并沿 Nurzhol Boulevard 步行看新城建筑；继续至 Ak Orda 一带看总统府外观。</p><div class="btnrow"><a class="btn light" href="https://a-vm.kz/en/objects/bayterek/" target="_blank">Bayterek 官方信息</a></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">15:20–17:15</div><h4>Khan Shatyr</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/khan-shatyr.jpg" alt="Khan Shatyr" loading="lazy"><p>参观 Norman Foster 设计的巨型帐篷建筑，并在室内休息。体力不足时可缩短这一站。</p><div class="btnrow"><a class="btn light" href="https://visitastana.kz/en/about-city/what-to-see/khan-shatyr-sec/" target="_blank">Visit Astana</a></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">17:15–18:00</div><h4>Khan Shatyr → NQZ</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/nqz-airport.jpg" alt="返回阿斯塔纳机场" loading="lazy"><p>乘车返回 NQZ T1，为晚间国际航班预留充足时间。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">18:00–19:00</div><h4>取行李 + 办理值机</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/nqz-airport.jpg" alt="NQZ T1" loading="lazy"><p>如早晨寄存了行李，先领取行李；随后确认 FS7961 值机柜台并办理20 kg托运行李。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">19:00–22:00</div><h4>NQZ T1 · 边检 + 晚餐 + 候机</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/nqz-airport.jpg" alt="阿斯塔纳机场候机" loading="lazy"><p>完成出境与安检后在候机区用晚餐，提前查看 FS7961 登机口。</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="time">22:30–03:55</div><h4>FS7961 · NQZ T1 → URC T4</h4><img class="step-photo" src="images/steps/flyarystan.webp" alt="FlyArystan" loading="lazy"><p>飞狮航空，订单显示1件20 kg托运行李；10/10凌晨03:55抵达乌鲁木齐天山国际机场 T4。</p></div>
  </div>
  <iframe class="map" loading="lazy" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Astana+Grand+Mosque&output=embed" title="阿斯塔纳地图"></iframe></article>''')

